TITLE 1D transport with exchange; output exchange composition
SOLUTION 0  Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
SOLUTION 1-10  Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -step true
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -punch_cells 8
    -punch_frequency 1
END
